# Markdown text
Headings, paragraphs, lists and quotes from plain lines

---

## Why trains

They are **faster** than buses between these cities,
and you can *work* on board with `wifi`.

- Lisbon to Coimbra: 1 h 40 min
- Coimbra to Porto: 1 h
  - With a stop in Aveiro

> Read the [timetable](https://example.com/timetable) before you go.

<b>This tag is shown as written, not as bold text.</b>

